From 345404328015f68c9c9845fc10eb078cc7e8eab2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Schiffhauer <Alexander.Schiffhauer@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 05:50:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] d3d11: Dither composition swap chain presents

Signed-off-by: Alexander Schiffhauer <Alexander.Schiffhauer@gmail.com>
---
